                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L\big(n,\{l'_i\}_{i=0}^d\big)
              are
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+equivalent"} homotopy equivalent
              iff there exists a
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
